<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ISRAEL OPEN DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the doubles final in the $328,000 Israel Open tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska and Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Noam Behr and Eyal Erlich (Israel) 6-3 6-2.</p>
</text>
